# A protocol for testing making prime panel A 10mL but keeping the same tip to not waste tips

# Acetylornithine *)
pipette 53.3 manu5 KIT1 --dispense_vol 53.3 --tipbox tipbox --pre_air_gap 30 --post_air_gap 2 --prewet 2 --prewet_vol 53.3 --keep_tip

